{"seq":1,"slug":"spatial-autocorrelation","title":"空间自相关分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/geospatial-data-analysis/spatial-statistics/spatial-autocorrelation","wordCount":644,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"空间自相关分析\">空间自相关分析</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>空间自相关（Spatial Autocorrelation）衡量地理邻近区域的属性值之间的关联程度。Tobler 地理学第一定律指出「万物皆相关，但距离近的事物比距离远的更相关」，空间自相关分析就是对这一规律的量化检验。它是空间统计学的基础，也是判断空间聚类、离散或随机分布模式的核心工具。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[空间自相关] --&gt; B[全局指标]&#10;    A --&gt; C[局部指标]&#10;    B --&gt; D[Moran&#39;s I]&#10;    B --&gt; E[Geary&#39;s C]&#10;    C --&gt; F[LISA]&#10;    C --&gt; G[Getis-Ord Gi*]&#10;    A --&gt; H[空间权重矩阵]&#10;    H --&gt; I[邻接权重]&#10;    H --&gt; J[距离权重]&#10;    H --&gt; K[K近邻权重]\">graph TD\n    A[空间自相关] --&gt; B[全局指标]\n    A --&gt; C[局部指标]\n    B --&gt; D[Moran's I]\n    B --&gt; E[Geary's C]\n    C --&gt; F[LISA]\n    C --&gt; G[Getis-Ord Gi*]\n    A --&gt; H[空间权重矩阵]\n    H --&gt; I[邻接权重]\n    H --&gt; J[距离权重]\n    H --&gt; K[K近邻权重]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>值域</th>\n<th>正相关含义</th>\n<th>负相关含义</th>\n<th>应用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Moran&#39;s I</td>\n<td>全局</td>\n<td>[-1, 1]</td>\n<td>聚类分布</td>\n<td>离散分布</td>\n<td>整体格局判断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Geary&#39;s C</td>\n<td>全局</td>\n<td>[0, 2]</td>\n<td>C&lt;1 聚类</td>\n<td>C&gt;1 离散</td>\n<td>局部差异敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LISA</td>\n<td>局部</td>\n<td>连续值</td>\n<td>高-高/低-低聚类</td>\n<td>高-低/低-高异质</td>\n<td>热点/冷点识别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Getis-Ord Gi*</td>\n<td>局部</td>\n<td>Z 分数</td>\n<td>热点</td>\n<td>冷点</td>\n<td>犯罪/疫情热点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"moran-s-i-统计量\">Moran&#39;s I 统计量</h2><h3 id=\"全局-moran-s-i\">全局 Moran&#39;s I</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;from libpysal.weights import Queen&#10;from esda.moran import Moran&#10;&#10;import geopandas as gpd&#10;&#10;gdf = gpd.read_file(&quot;districts.shp&quot;)&#10;&#10;w = Queen.from_dataframe(gdf)&#10;w.transform = &#39;r&#39;&#10;&#10;mi = Moran(gdf[&#39;house_price&#39;].values, w)&#10;print(f&quot;Moran&#39;s I: {mi.I:.4f}&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;期望值 E[I]: {mi.EI:.4f}&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;Z 分数: {mi.z_norm:.4f}&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;P 值: {mi.p_norm:.4f}&quot;)&#10;&#10;# Moran&#39;s I &gt; 0 且 P &lt; 0.05 → 显著正空间自相关（聚类）&#10;# Moran&#39;s I &lt; 0 且 P &lt; 0.05 → 显著负空间自相关（离散）&#10;# P &gt; 0.05 → 空间随机分布\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> libpysal.weights </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Queen</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> esda.moran </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Moran</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> geopandas </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gpd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gdf </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gpd.read_file(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"districts.shp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Queen.from_dataframe(gdf)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">w.transform </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'r'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Moran(gdf[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'house_price'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].values, w)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Moran's I: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mi.I</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.4f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"期望值 E[I]: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mi.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">EI</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.4f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Z 分数: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mi.z_norm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.4f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"P 值: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mi.p_norm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.4f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Moran's I > 0 且 P &#x3C; 0.05 → 显著正空间自相关（聚类）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Moran's I &#x3C; 0 且 P &#x3C; 0.05 → 显著负空间自相关（离散）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># P > 0.05 → 空间随机分布</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"空间权重矩阵\">空间权重矩阵</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>权重类型</th>\n<th>构建方式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Queen 邻接</td>\n<td>共享边或顶点</td>\n<td>行政区划</td>\n<td>8 邻居（含对角）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rook 邻接</td>\n<td>仅共享边</td>\n<td>规则网格</td>\n<td>4 邻居</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>K 近邻</td>\n<td>最近 K 个</td>\n<td>点数据</td>\n<td>固定邻居数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>距离带</td>\n<td>距离阈值内</td>\n<td>点/面数据</td>\n<td>邻居数不固定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核函数</td>\n<td>距离衰减权重</td>\n<td>连续变量</td>\n<td>平滑效果好</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"局部空间自相关-lisa\">局部空间自相关 LISA</h2><p>局部 Moran&#39;s I（LISA）将全局指标分解到每个空间单元，识别局部聚类和异常值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from esda.moran import Moran_Local&#10;import matplotlib.pyplot as plt&#10;&#10;lisa = Moran_Local(gdf[&#39;house_price&#39;].values, w)&#10;&#10;fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(16, 8))&#10;&#10;gdf[&#39;lisa_cluster&#39;] = lisa.q&#10;sig = lisa.p_sim &lt; 0.05&#10;gdf.loc[~sig, &#39;lisa_cluster&#39;] = 0&#10;&#10;cluster_labels = {0: &#39;不显著&#39;, 1: &#39;高-高&#39;, 2: &#39;低-高&#39;, 3: &#39;低-低&#39;, 4: &#39;高-低&#39;}&#10;gdf[&#39;cluster_label&#39;] = gdf[&#39;lisa_cluster&#39;].map(cluster_labels)&#10;&#10;gdf.plot(column=&#39;cluster_label&#39;, categorical=True,&#10;         legend=True, ax=axes[0], cmap=&#39;RdBu&#39;)&#10;axes[0].set_title(&#39;LISA 聚类图&#39;)&#10;&#10;from splot.esda import moran_scatterplot&#10;moran_scatterplot(lisa, p=0.05, ax=axes[1])&#10;axes[1].set_title(&quot;Moran 散点图&quot;)&#10;plt.tight_layout()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> esda.moran </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Moran_Local</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> matplotlib.pyplot </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lisa </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Moran_Local(gdf[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'house_price'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].values, w)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">fig, axes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plt.subplots(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">figsize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gdf[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lisa_cluster'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lisa.q</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sig </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lisa.p_sim </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.05</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gdf.loc[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">~</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sig, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lisa_cluster'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cluster_labels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'不显著'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'高-高'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'低-高'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color: