n><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.96</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (gdf[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'p_value'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hotspot'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Hot Spot (95%)'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gdf.loc[(gdf[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'z_score'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2.58</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (gdf[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'p_value'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hotspot'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Hot Spot (99%)'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gdf.loc[(gdf[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'z_score'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.96</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (gdf[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'p_value'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hotspot'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Cold Spot (95%)'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gdf.loc[(gdf[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'z_score'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.58</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (gdf[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'p_value'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hotspot'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Cold Spot (99%)'</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>空间自相关是空间统计的基石，量化地理近邻属性值的关联程度</li>\n<li>Moran&#39;s I 是最常用的全局空间自相关指标，正值表示聚类、负值表示离散</li>\n<li>空间权重矩阵的选择直接影响分析结果，需根据数据特征选择合适的邻接定义</li>\n<li>LISA 将全局指标分解到局部，识别高-高、低-低聚类和高-低、低-高异常值</li>\n<li>Getis-Ord Gi* 热点分析直接输出 Z 分数，适合犯罪热点、疫情聚集等场景</li>\n<li>所有空间自相关分析都需要进行统计显著性检验（通常使用蒙特卡洛置换检验）</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"空间自相关分析","id":"空间自相关分析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Moran's I 统计量","id":"moran-s-i-统计量"},{"level":3,"text":"全局 Moran's I","id":"全局-moran-s-i"},{"level":3,"text":"空间权重矩阵","id":"空间权重矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"局部空间自相关 LISA","id":"局部空间自相关-lisa"},{"level":2,"text":"Getis-Ord 热点分析","id":"getis-ord-热点分析"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"空间机器学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/geospatial-data-analysis/applied-geospatial/spatial-machine-learning"},"next":{"title":"点模式分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/geospatial-data-analysis/spatial-statistics/point-pattern-analysis"}}